{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_deployment_rtk_deployment_guide", "label": "C-RTK 部署与使用指南 (C-RTK Deployment & Usage Guide)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/Deployment/RTK_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "适用基线 PX4 v1.17、CUAV 7-Nano、ROS 2 Humble、Jetson；目标是让 RTK 改善水平定位同时保持既有 ROS 任务逻辑不变；RTK 不是避障系统，也不替代视觉精准降落或人工遥控器接管；不适用于仅买单个 RTK 模块、NTRIP 或双天线航向方案"}, {"id": "docs_deployment_rtk_deployment_guide_phased_deployment", "label": "分阶段部署路线 (阶段 A TF02-Pro → 阶段 B C-RTK)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/Deployment/RTK_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "阶段 A 只部署 TF02-Pro 改善垂直高度估计，不会解决 GPS 水平漂移；阶段 B 部署 C-RTK 时保留 TF02-Pro、不需要为两种传感器增加 ROS 节点；RTK 收敛期间让 ROS 提前运行但任务必须停在等待状态，只有 RTK 质量满足条件才允许起飞"}, {"id": "docs_deployment_rtk_deployment_guide_tf02pro", "label": "TF02-Pro 距离传感器融合 (SENS_EN_TF02PRO / EKF2_RNG_CTRL)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/Deployment/RTK_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "当前 SENS_EN_TF02PRO=0、EKF2_RNG_CTRL=1（Conditional Range Aid）；启用时只改 SENS_EN_TF02PRO: 0→1，通过 distance_sensor、vehicle_local_position.dist_bottom_valid、estimator_status_flags.cs_rng_hgt 验证融合；不要为启用它修改 home_x/home_y、航点或速度"}, {"id": "docs_deployment_rtk_deployment_guide_rtk_architecture", "label": "RTK 修正链路架构 (Base→QGC→PX4→Rover)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/Deployment/RTK_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "C-RTK 基站─USB─>QGroundControl─MAVLink2/数传─>PX4─GPS口─>Rover，RTCM 经 GPS_RTCM_DATA 注入；EKF2 本地 NED→vehicle_odometry→Jetson Ethernet/MicroXRCE-DDS→px4_control→/drone/pose→任务 FSM；控制位置来自 PX4 EKF2 输出而不是 ROS 侧直接计算经纬度"}, {"id": "docs_deployment_rtk_deployment_guide_invariants", "label": "RTK 接入不变量 (Invariants)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/Deployment/RTK_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "真机 NED 原点仍是 PX4/EKF 起飞时建立的局部原点，home_x/home_y/home_z 仍是 ROS World 映射偏移，不要因加 RTK 而改动；Jetson 与 PX4 的 Ethernet/uXRCE-DDS 连接仍只承担 ROS 2 话题，不能替代基站到 QGC 再到飞控的 RTCM/MAVLink 通道；现有航点/waypoint_tolerance/视觉目标坐标/状态机均不需修改；必须保留 RC 接管、硬件急停和人工监控，RTK Fixed 不是飞行安全的充分条件"}, {"id": "docs_deployment_rtk_deployment_guide_zero_code_changes", "label": "零代码部署原则 (Zero ROS/Python Code Changes)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/Deployment/RTK_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "px4_bridge 已订阅 /fmu/out/vehicle_odometry 把 NED 位姿变换为 /drone/pose，也已订阅 vehicle_gps_position 但只记录 fix_type 和卫星数；基础 RTK 部署的 ROS/Python 改动量为 0 行，所需变化是飞控参数、物理接线、QGC 与试飞流程"}, {"id": "docs_deployment_rtk_deployment_guide_safety_gap", "label": "RTK 安全缺口 (失锁仍放行)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/Deployment/RTK_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "完整主任务只依赖 PX4 preflight_ok 和 RC 解锁，分阶段 test_mission 也只检查相同状态；SensorGps 消息含 fix_type/eph/rtcm_msg_used/rtcm_injection_rate/CRC 但测试桥没有订阅、主桥没把它变成任务准入条件；RTK 失锁为普通 3D GPS 时当前任务会继续飞行"}, {"id": "docs_deployment_rtk_deployment_guide_position_quality_gate", "label": "PositionQualityGate 质量门模块设计", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/Deployment/RTK_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "在 px4_control 新建深模块，interface 仅 observe_gps/observe_local_position/is_ready/reason；内部处理 fix_type==6 (RTK Fixed)、rtcm_msg_used==2、无 CRC、数据年龄、eph 门限、xy_valid；任务 FSM 只读 bridge.position_ready 不读 GNSS 原始字段，同一 interface 服务主任务和 test_mission；仅当 RTK Fixed、RTCM 被使用、数据未超时且 EKF XY 有效才允许从 INIT 进入 ARM；飞行中失锁停止发布新航点并进入预先评审的安全动作（建议悬停通知操作者），未经现场安全评审不自动 LAND/RTL/disarm；建议参数 require_rtk_fixed/rtk_max_eph_m=0.15/rtk_warmup_s=10/rtk_data_timeout_s=1.0"}, {"id": "docs_deployment_rtk_deployment_guide_qgc_survey_in", "label": "QGroundControl Survey-In 建链流程", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/Deployment/RTK_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "建链顺序：户外开阔场地启动 QGC→Base 经 USB 连接→同一 QGC 同时连接飞控（双向 MAVLink2）→等待 Survey-In 完成（可保存复用固定坐标，但移动后的基站不可继续用旧坐标）→QGC 显示 RTK 正常且飞控 GPS 为 3D RTK Fixed；信号 Fixed/Float 反复切换先查天线/基站遮挡/数传上行/RTCM，不通过放宽 EKF 参数掩盖"}, {"id": "docs_deployment_rtk_deployment_guide_ekf2_params", "label": "PX4 RTK 参数矩阵 (EKF2_REQ_FIX / REQ_EPH / GPS_UBX_MODE / COM_ARM_WO_GPS)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/Deployment/RTK_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "首飞基线来自 controller_params_v3.params：GPS_1_CONFIG=201、EKF2_GPS_CTRL=7（经纬度/高度/3D速度融合，不加双天线航向 bit3）、EKF2_REQ_FIX=3（严格策略可评审后设 6）、EKF2_REQ_EPH=3.0m（v1.17 下限 2m，不能设 0.1m 模拟 RTK 门限）、GPS_UBX_MODE=0（模式 5 是 RTCM 直接接 Rover UART2 的另一种接法）、COM_ARM_WO_GPS=1→0（只要求全球位置检查通过，不是 RTK Fixed 开关）、MAV_PROTO_VER=2；EKF2_REQ_FIX=6 会阻止退化时普通 GPS 进入 EKF，但也可能导致飞行中定位状态退化，不得在首次链路验证前设置"}, {"id": "docs_deployment_rtk_deployment_guide_convergence_strategy", "label": "收敛时间优化策略 (不重复 Survey-In)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/Deployment/RTK_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "区分 Base Survey-In（估计绝对坐标，要求越高越慢，只在首次部署/基站移动后做）与 Rover RTK Fixed（每次开机先建修正链路）；本任务坐标链路是起飞点局部 NED 原点→20-60m 相对航线，Base 不移动时其绝对坐标误差表现为整个局部坐标系共同平移，不按同样大小破坏相对距离；不要为每次 10cm Survey-In 延迟任务数小时；现场超时 90-120s 后仍是 Float 就取消架次转人工检查，不放宽到 Float 执行高精度航线；不要通过断电/移动 Base/遮挡位置/放宽 EKF2_REQ_FIX 加快收敛"}, {"id": "docs_deployment_rtk_deployment_guide_verification", "label": "量化验收与故障定位 (Quantitative Acceptance & Troubleshooting)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/Deployment/RTK_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "每项至少重复 5 次并记录风/Base 位置/卫星状况/QGC 固定状态/机架载荷；验收项：静态 RTK 连续 30s Fixed、修正链路 rtcm_msg_used=2 且无 CRC 失败、EKF 融合 cs_gnss_pos/cs_gnss_vel 无 fault、20m 往返端点误差显著优于普通 GNSS 基线；eph/epv 是接收机估计误差不是地面真值；用 ulog2csv 导出 vehicle_gps_position/estimator_status/vehicle_local_position 检查 eph、fix_type、xy_reset_counter、pos_test_ratio"}, {"id": "controller_params_v3_params", "label": "PX4 Controller Params Baseline (controller_params_v3.params)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "/home/ryder/drone_tasks_ws/controller_params_v3.params", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_deployment_rtk_deployment_guide", "target": "docs_deployment_rtk_deployment_guide_phased_deployment", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/Deployment/RTK_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_deployment_rtk_deployment_guide", "target": "docs_deployment_rtk_deployment_guide_tf02pro", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/Deployment/RTK_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_deployment_rtk_deployment_guide", "target": "docs_deployment_rtk_deployment_guide_rtk_architecture", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/Deployment/RTK_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_deployment_rtk_deployment_guide", "target": "docs_deployment_rtk_deployment_guide_invariants", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confiden